  "notes": "No dated CloudHQ statement on building completion or a signed tenant was found. Capacity figures conflict: CloudHQ's undated page and 2023 coverage give six 48 MW buildings (288 MW), Switchgear Magazine (citing BNamericas) gives three 120 MW buildings in phase 1, and Construction Review gives 288 to 360 MW across six buildings, with more than 210 MW expected in early operations. Construction Review's article is dated 8 April 2026 as updated from a September 2025 original.",
